  m_Name: Innercover1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  partName: Right Inner Cover
  description: The Right Inner Cover serves a similar purpose to the Left Inner Cover,
    providing structural support and protection for the engine's internal components.
    Its design and positioning are carefully optimized to work in tandem with the
    Left Inner Cover and other engine components. An interesting detail is that the
    Right Inner Cover's material and shape are selected to minimize weight while
    maintaining the necessary strength and durability.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1ed188c6f298f6d459055503a043003c, type: 3}
